    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You seek to join the Free Captains of the Shackles and have learned everything you need to know about sailing and bossing people around. Now you just need a crew and a ship.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Intimidation skill and the Sailing Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Group Coercion skill feat."
